Hello,

see README.ncr53c8xx in drivers/scsi for list of supported chips. The
sym53c8xx driver does support SYM53C1010 and that Tekram card is very
good choice. I use Tekram controllers in a lot of production machines
with no problems.

Sincerely, David Haring

